
---

## قدم ۴: اضافه کردن GitHub Action برای اجرای خودکار هر ساعت

پوشه `.github/workflows` بساز و فایل `hourly-scan.yml` با این محتوا:

```yaml
name: Hourly Brute Force Check

on:
  schedule:
    - cron: '0 * * * *'   # هر ساعت
  workflow_dispatch:

jobs:
  check:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: Set up Python
        uses: actions/setup-python@v5
        with:
          python-version: '3.10'
      - name: Install requests
        run: pip install requests
      - name: Run detector (simulated Linux)
        run: python detect_bruteforce.py --os linux --minutes 60 --threshold 5
      - name: Upload logs if any
        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        with:
          name: alert-log
          path: |
            *.log
